SUMMARY:Eyes Up Here Comedy: Mean Girls Edition
DESCRIPTION:Queers to the Front!\nModelface Comedy presents Eyes Up Here C
 omedy at Ginger's Revenge!\nEyes Up Here Comedy is a night featuring all f
 emme comedians and this month we have a special show featuring comedians f
 rom Asheville and around the South East.\nHosted by local favorite Erin Te
 rry.\nages 18+\ndoors at 6:30pm\, show at 7pm\nTickets $18 GA\, $23 Premiu
 m Seating
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/queers-to-the-front/events/316785397/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260930T201924Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260930T201924Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Queers to the Front!
UID:event_316143184@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261003T050045Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261007T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261007T210000
SUMMARY:Everybody But You Bro Comedy Open Mic
DESCRIPTION:Queers to the Front!\nJoin Eyes Up Here Comedy & Modelface Com
 edy for the premiere open mic for the rest of us -- Everybody But You Bro 
 is a comedy mic for women\, non-binary\, queer and femme folks to take the
  stage and tell jokes -- up to 5 minutes.\n\nThis is a queer and trans-inc
 lusive mic.\nWe don’t punch down y’all!\n\nSign ups at 6pm and shows s
 tarts at 6:30pm and it’s show up and go up! Located in the Comedy Baseme
 nt at The RAD Brew Co.\nAll are welcome for the audience\, however heckler
 s will be asked to leave\n\nFree event\, Suggested $10 donations are highl
 y encouraged\nHosted by Erin Terry\, Danny Felix and Linda Barsi\nStick ar
 ound after the mic for our Joke Writing Workshop at 8pm
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/queers-to-the-front/events/316143184/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260816T172340Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260816T172340Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Queers to the Front!
UID:event_316786271@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261003T050045Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261010T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261010T210000
SUMMARY:Comedy at The Funk: Brittany Carney
DESCRIPTION:Queers to the Front!\nModelface Comedy Club brings you the bes
 t comedians from all over the country! This week we have Brittany Carny fr
 om NYC!\n\nBrittany Carney performs around the country\, and is based in N
 ew York. She is listed as one of Vulture Magazine's "Comedians You Should 
 and Will Know." She wrote for and acted in That Damn Michael Che\, and app
 ears on Fantasmas\, on HBO Max. Brittany has also written for Adult Swim a
 nd and Audible. She has opened Stavros Halkias\, Gary Gulman\, Joe Pera\, 
 and Moshe Kasher. Brittany's debut special\, That Is My Horse\," is availa
 ble on Youtube and Prime TV.\n\nages 18+\nDoors at 6:30pm\, show at 7pm\nF
 ull dinner menu available\nTickets $18
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/queers-to-the-front/events/316786271/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260930T212536Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260930T212536Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Queers to the Front!
UID:event_316504080@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261003T050045Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261018T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261018T170000
SUMMARY:Queer Girls Literary Reading!
DESCRIPTION:Queers to the Front!\nJoin us for our Seventeenth Annual Queer
  Girls Literary Reading\, a celebration of Asheville's queer literary wome
 n! Local and regional writers will share their original poetry and prose. 
 This year's event will take place at the White Horse in Black Mountain. Ad
 mission: **Pay What You Can** (suggested donation at the White Horse is $1
 5--more if you can\, less if you can't). Link to buy tickets: [https://whi
 tehorseblackmountain.org/product/queer-girls-literary-reading/](https://wh
 itehorseblackmountain.org/product/queer-girls-literary-reading/) or you ca
 n buy tickets at the door.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/queers-to-the-front/events/316504080/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260910T194341Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260910T194341Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Queers to the Front!
UID:event_316786431@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261003T050045Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261025T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261025T210000
SUMMARY:RAD WITCHES\, Femme Comedy in The RAD
DESCRIPTION:Queers to the Front!\nModelface Comedy Club brings the best co
 medians from all over the country to Asheville\, NC. This week we are exci
 ted to have a very spooky all femme show!\n\nWe are celebrating the most h
 aunting time of year with some truly RAD Women! Join some of the best femm
 e comedians from Asheville and beyond for a night of unforgettable laughs 
 at The RAD Brew Co. in the River Arts District!\n\nages 18+\nDoors at 6:30
 pm\, show at 7pm\nTickets $18
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/queers-to-the-front/events/316786431/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260930T214209Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260930T214209Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
